        "title": "Why the spelling changes",
        "body": "In the combined points the second word softens. {{Dwyrain}} becomes {{ddwyrain}} and {{gorllewin}} becomes {{orllewin}}. That is why south-west is {{de-orllewin}} and not {{de-gorllewin}}."
